  "body": "Originally proposed/recommended in issue #560.\r\n\r\n**requirement**\r\n7.1.1 Verify that the application does not log credentials, session tokens or payment details.\r\n\r\n**problem**\r\nIn reality, for debuging/tracking/investigate there is still need to log session identifier somehow - in practice same hash of session id is logged instead of original session id.\r\n\r\n**recommendation**\r\nMaybe 7.1.1 should be widened to something like \"does not log\" > \"does not log as plain-text\". Recommendation how to log should be given. Otherwise some may start logging them in base64 encoding.",
